# Generated by `gitnexus analyze`, which writes the same block into both AGENTS.md
# and CLAUDE.md. CLAUDE.md is this repo's one tracked instruction file, so the
# duplicate is ignored rather than suppressed: `--skip-agents-md` would also stop
# CLAUDE.md's block being refreshed, which is the half worth keeping current.
AGENTS.md

# CodeGraph's per-project index. Removed from this repo in favour of GitNexus,
# but ignored so a stray `codegraph init` can never commit a database again.
.codegraph/
